BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163394@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260505T180000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will be taking a maintenance outage of Internal Market Monitoring Asset Characteristics (IMMAC) on Tuesday\, May 5\, 2026 from 14:00 to 18:00 Hrs.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be taking a maintenance outage of Internal Market Monitoring Asset Characteristics (IMMAC) on Tuesday\, May 5\, 2026 from 14:00 to 18:00 Hrs. During the outage\, users will not be able to connect to IMMAC.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163394
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163394
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163361@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260505T190000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will be taking Sandbox and Production maintenance outages  the CROW Outage Scheduler on May 4 and 5\, 2026\, from 15:00 to 18:00 Hrs.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be taking maintenance outages of CROW Outage Scheduler\, in both the Sandbox and Production environments. The CROW Outage Scheduler application and CROW web services will be unavailable during these times.\n\nSandox environment outage: Monday\, May 4\, 2026\, 15:00 to 18:00 Hrs.\n\nProduction environment outage: Tuesday\, May 5\, 2026\, 15:00 to 18:00 Hrs.\n\nPlease contact Participant Support and Solutions if you have any questions.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163361
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163361
END:VEVENT
