DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260512T200000Z
SUMMARY:IT Service Disruption Notice: ISO-NE's Market Information Server (MIS) Secure FTP (SFTP)
DESCRIPTION:We are actively investigating connectivity issues impacting ISO New England’s Market Information Server (MIS) Secure FTP system. Users are intermittently unable to connect to their MIS SFTP accounts.\n\nOur technical teams are diligently working to restore full functionality as quickly as possible.\n\nIf you have questions regarding this message\, please contact the Participant Support and Solutions Team by submitting a case via Ask ISO\, emailing AskISO@iso-ne.com or by phone at (413) 540-4220.\n\nWe sincerely apologize for the inconvenience caused and appreciate your patience as we work to resolve this issue.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163500
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163500
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163501@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260512T205700Z
SUMMARY:IT Service Restored: ISO-NE Market Information Server (MIS) Secure FTP (SFTP)  
DESCRIPTION:We have resolved the connectivity issues impacting ISO New England’s Market Information Server (MIS) Secure FTP system. Full functionality has been restored\, and our technical teams are monitoring the system. Thank you for your patience as we worked to resolve this issue. \n\nIf you have questions regarding this message\, please contact the Participant Support and Solutions Team by submitting a case via Ask ISO\, emailing AskISO@iso-ne.com\, or by phone at (413) 540-4220.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163501
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163501
END:VEVENT
