UID:163511@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260519T172000Z
SUMMARY:[CANCELLED] CANCELLED | ISO New England will update the EMS / Power System & Market Model on Tuesday\, May 19\, 2026 from 13:20-15:45 Hrs
DESCRIPTION:** CANCELLED **\nISO New England will update the EMS / Power System & Market Model on Tuesday\, May 19\, 2026. The update is scheduled for approximately 13:20-15:45 Hrs. During this time period\, participants can expect the loss of 5-minute Real Time LMP and RCP postings to the ISO's website\, and stale DDP signals to their Electronic Dispatch RTUs. Updated DDPs will resume upon completion of the EMS outage at approximately 15:45 Hrs. External market applications will remain open during the outage.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163511
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163511
END:VEVENT
