BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163662@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260519T180000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct an outage of SMD Settlement Applications on Tuesday May 19\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 17:00 hrs.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct an outage of SMD Settlement Applications on Tuesday May 19\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 17:00 hrs. for software maintenance. During the outage users will not be able to connect to the following SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load. The Financial Assurance Management application will also be unavailable. MIS Operational reports are delayed.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163662
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163662
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163676@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260519T200000Z
SUMMARY:M/LCC 2 Implemented on Tuesday\, May 19\, 2026 at 16:00 in ALL OF NEW ENGLAND
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England is implementing Master Local Control Center Procedure No. 2 (M/LCC 2)\, Abnormal Conditions Alert\, on Tuesday\, May 19\, 2026 at 16:00 in ALL OF NEW ENGLAND due to Capacity Deficiency.  Master Local Control Center Procedure No. 2 requests that you will not engage in activities that may jeopardize the availability of resources or transmission under your control.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163676
