UID:163669@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260521T172000Z
SUMMARY:UPDATED | ISO New England will update the EMS / Power System & Market Model on Thursday\, May 21\, 2026\, from 13:20-15:45 Hrs
DESCRIPTION:Revised to reflect new date: ISO New England will update the EMS / Power System & Market Model on Thursday\, May 21\, 2026. The update is scheduled for approximately 13:20-15:45 Hrs. During this time period\, participants can expect the loss of 5-minute Real Time LMP and RCP postings to the ISO's website\, and stale DDP signals to their Electronic Dispatch RTUs. Updated DDPs will resume upon completion of the EMS outage at approximately 15:45 Hrs. External market applications will remain open during the outage.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163669
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163669
END:VEVENT
