BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163851@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T085128Z
DTSTART:20260527T143600Z
SUMMARY:Forward Capacity Market Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Period and Monthly Reconfiguration Auction for August 2026 to Open
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1\, Sections III.13.4 and III.13.5\, the submission period for submitting Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Contracts to the Forward Capacity Market CSO Bilateral Period for August 2026 will open on June 10\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on June 11\, 2026 (11:00). The submission period for submitting bids and offers to the Forward Capacity Market Monthly Reconfiguration Auction for August 2026 will open on June 22\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on June 23\, 2026 (11:00).\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163851
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163851
END:VEVENT
