SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct a maintenance outage of SMD Settlement Applications from Thursday\, May 28\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00 Hrs
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct a maintenance outage of SMD Settlement Applications from Thursday\, May 28\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00 Hrs\, in both Production and Sandbox environments. During the outage users will not be able to connect to the following SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load. The Financial Assurance Management (FAM) application will also be unavailable. MIS Operational reports are delayed.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163865
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163865
END:VEVENT
