SUMMARY:NX Application Transition to FERC Order 881 
LOCATION:Webinar
DESCRIPTION:This session will cover changes to the NX-9 form fields\, the removal of traditional seasonal ratings\, and the addition of Limit Exchange Portal (LEP) information resulting from FERC Order 881.  Instructions and the timeline for migrating all existing NX-9 data to the post-881 format will also be provided.  \n\n\n\nRegister Now.\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163675
